p may not be as effective...\" This is not undermining with rare qualifiers about health risks; it's about effectiveness, not danger. It does not say \"but in rare cases...\". So it's not undermining reassurance with rare exceptions. The mention of residue risk is already addressed. So no.\n\nThus only tag 2 applies.\n\nThe JSON output: {\"tags\": [2]}",
