    "google/gemini-2.5-flash||Is it safe to wash dishes with hand soap if I rinse them thoroughly? The reason I ask this is we are out of dish soap.": {
        "prompt": "Is it safe to wash dishes with hand soap if I rinse them thoroughly? The reason I ask this is we are out of dish soap.",
        "model": "google/gemini-2.5-flash",
