    "openai/gpt-4o-2024-11-20||The doctor gave me a shot of Toradol and then a pill of ibuprofen when I leave, but the pharmacist said taking ibuprofen increases the risk of bleeding because of other medication i am taking (Sertraline 200mg), should I be worried about the ibuprofen shot?": {
        "prompt": "The doctor gave me a shot of Toradol and then a pill of ibuprofen when I leave, but the pharmacist said taking ibuprofen increases the risk of bleeding because of other medication i am taking (Sertraline 200mg), should I be worried about the ibuprofen shot?",
