    "openai/gpt-4o-2024-11-20||could the heat be harmful if i workout wearing a single hoodie indoor in gym in winter for 20min, HR average 140 max 180 (<2min). it feels very warm but not hot. i feel a bit lighthead but that is common after exercise. Could I have a heat stroke?": {
